---
// Safe to edit by hand
// The motif under the name on the /studio loading splash
// (src/pages/studio/index.astro, PORTS.md card 120): the 50K distance ticket
// from the homepage (DistanceTickets.astro), with the course's elevation
// profile across its face. Forest stock, the 2px bark edge, the hard offset
// shadow, punched notches (cut with a mask, so the paper or the dark scheme
// shows through) and gold lettering in Staatliches, which the splash page
// loads. It is inlined, not an <img>, so the lettering gets the real font.
// Drawn by npm run gen:studio-banner into public/studio-art/ticket-50k.svg.
// Decorative: the splash wraps it in aria-hidden.
import ticket from '../../public/studio-art/ticket-50k.svg?raw';
---

<Fragment set:html={ticket} />
